        "title": "<h2>Endless Ways to Personalise</h2>",
        "description": "<p>The beauty of the NMJ Charm Offering lies in creating a piece that's uniquely yours. Every necklace can be <em>customised to reflect your story</em>, with thoughtful details that hold lasting meaning.</p>",
        "colour_style": "dark",
